    <node id="LATITUD">
      <data key="d0">NONE</data>
      <data key="d1"> The latitude of Islote Puntudo is 48&#176; 7&#8217; 3&#8221; S, which indicates its position in the southern hemisphere. Additionally, there is a reference to the "Latitud de la isla Blanca Este," but no specific numerical value is provided. Therefore, the only concrete information we have is that Islote Puntudo is located at the specified latitude in the southern hemisphere.</data>
