    <node id="M.: 500">
      <data key="d0">POPULATION</data>
      <data key="d1"> The entity "M.: 500" refers to the population of males in either Isla Rasa or Islote Gran Robredo. According to the provided descriptions, the population of males in both of these locations is reported to be 500. However, it is not explicitly stated if this population of 500 males is evenly distributed between the two islands or if it refers to the population of one specific island. Given the information available, it can be said that the population of males in either Isla Rasa or Islote Gran Robredo is 500. To provide a more accurate description, additional information is required to determine if the population of 500 males is specific to one island or if it is divided between the two islands.</data>
