    <node id="BAH&#205;A DE LOS NODALES">
      <data key="d0">NONE</data>
      <data key="d1"> "BAH&#205;A DE LOS NODALES" is a bay located along the coast of Santa Cruz. This geographical feature is mentioned in relation to the nearby locations of two small islands: Isla Guano and Islote Puntudo.</data>
      <data key="d2">5a07380f5aada9c6c6ef41f242e1c536,94f4298857de42f37006e6e3561c06ee</data>
      <data key="d6">118</data>
