    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="AVES">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9"> Los huevos son producidos por las aves. (Eggs are produced by birds.)

While the description list includes both "producen" and "son producidos por," I have concatenated the descriptions in a way that accurately reflects the relationship between the entities while also maintaining the original intent of the descriptions. The primary language of the text is Spanish, and the entities provided are "HUEVOS" and "AVES." The final summary is written in the third person and includes the entity names for context. The information conveyed is solely based on the provided text, and no additional information has been added.</data>
      <data key="d10">3b8a637af69ae3ba996edaf49f1ed1f0</data>
      <data key="d11">ac5ddbd173b64f238425357b66dd439c</data>
      <data key="d12">711</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="PERIFORMES">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9"> "HUEVOS (eggs) and PERIFORMES (periforms) both refer to entities with a particular shape. The primary language of the text is Spanish. While the first description suggests that 'HUEVOS son de forma' (eggs are of a certain shape), the second description states that 'tienen forma de' (have a certain shape), referring to PERIFORMES. Given that both descriptions relate to shape, it can be inferred that HUEVOS and PERIFORMES share a similar shape characteristic. Therefore, a comprehensive summary would be: 'HUEVOS y PERIFORMES se refieren a entidades que comparten una forma particular' (HUEVOS and PERIFORMES refer to entities that share a particular shape)."</data>
      <data key="d10">3b8a637af69ae3ba996edaf49f1ed1f0</data>
      <data key="d11">5b0faceab3d14412abdf132b2253c096</data>
      <data key="d12">712</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="CELESTE">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">son de color</data>
      <data key="d10">3b8a637af69ae3ba996edaf49f1ed1f0</data>
      <data key="d11">a0981d3c38ab45188679e175d23801db</data>
      <data key="d12">713</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HUEVOS" target="DOS">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9"> Los huevos generalmente suelen contener, en el caso de la pareja formada por las entidades "HUEVOS" y "DOS", la mayor&#237;a de las veces estos huevos contienen embriones en desarrollo, representando una etapa crucial en el ciclo de vida de muchas especies marinas. Es relevante mencionar que la frecuencia y cantidad de huevos pueden variar entre diferentes especies, y su cuidado y protecci&#243;n son esenciales para asegurar la supervivencia y el &#233;xito reproductivo de los organismos marinos.</data>
      <data key="d10">3b8a637af69ae3ba996edaf49f1ed1f0</data>
      <data key="d11">460f33f1fec24205a2ba47cbb0471751</data>
      <data key="d12">714</data>
      <data key="d13">2</data>
    </edge>
