    <edge source="DEP&#211;SITOS GUANEROS" target="GUANO">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9"> "DEP&#211;SITOS GUANEROS form and produceGUANO."

In this context, "DEP&#211;SITOS GUANEROS" (Guano Deposits) are the entities that create and generate "GUANO" (guano). Guano is a valuable resource in marine ecosystems, primarily composed of bird or bat excrement, which accumulates over time in specific sites. Guano deposits are essential for understanding the nutrient cycling and productivity of marine systems.</data>
      <data key="d10">3b8a637af69ae3ba996edaf49f1ed1f0</data>
      <data key="d11">b91d4726e98544548742335142cb80d5</data>
